        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word that Isaiah the son of Amoz saw concerning Judah and Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass in the last days,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mountain of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "house shall be established in the top of the mountains, and shall be exalted above the hills; and all nations shall flow unto it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And many people shall go and say, Come ye, and let us go up to the mountain of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to the house of the God of Jacob; and he will teach us of his ways, and we will walk in his paths: for out of Zion shall go forth the law, and the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall judge among the nations, and shall rebuke many people: and they shall beat their swords into plowshares, and their spears into pruninghooks: nation shall not lift up sword against nation, neither shall they learn war any more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O house of Jacob, come ye, and let us walk in the light of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore thou hast forsaken thy people the house of Jacob, because they be replenished from the east, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soothsayers like the Philistines, and they please themselves in the children of strangers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their land also is full of silver and gold, neither",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is there any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "end of their treasures; their land is also full of horses, neither",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is there any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "end of their chariots:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their land also is full of idols; they worship the work of their own hands, that which their own fingers have made:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the mean man boweth down, and the great man humbleth himself: therefore forgive them not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
